  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5003.03 Minimum Requirements.\n\n(a) An applicant for a certificate of competency shall meet the following minimum requirements:\n\n(1) Compliance with the application procedures set forth in Saf-C 5003.04; and\n\n(2) Pass a written competency test administered by the commissioner.\n\n(b) If an applicant cannot read or write English, the written competency test shall be administered orally by the commissioner.\n\n(c) The competency test cited in (a)(2) above shall test the person's knowledge of the rules and the general procedures for display of display fireworks.\n\n(d) For the purposes of (a)(2) above, an applicant shall receive a score of 80% or higher in order to pass the test.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; amd by #7481, eff 4-25-01; paragraphs (a), (b) and (d) EXPIRED: 7-1-03; amd by #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04; paragraphs (a), (b) and (d) EXPIRED: 1-10-05; amd by #8261, eff 1-21-05; amd by #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17; ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
